lbackend inventory rows. Leaf-1 production untouched.\\n32:- EVIDENCE: outcome `TASK-260906-vmzk0y_outcome.md` on the board task (11/11 AC rows with call sites, 19-row mutant table, gates with exit codes, candidate tree OID verified by `ls-tree`).\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 3282,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 821,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}"}}}
